    {
      "text": "E.3",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        677.6729125976562,
        86.9239730834961,
        686.5197143554688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Auto-Regressive Transformer dynamics model (ART)",
      "bbox": [
        97.8828353881836,
        677.6729125976562,
        339.86444091796875,
        686.5197143554688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We follow Chen et al. (2021) in our transformer dynamics model, leaving out the rewards tokens",
      "bbox": [
        71.49199676513672,
        697.9808959960938,
        540.166748046875,
        707.9434814453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and the time-step embedding.",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        709.9368896484375,
        212.0811309814453,
        719.8994750976562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Each state and action is mapped into a single token with a sepa-",
      "bbox": [
        223.99081420898438,
        709.9368896484375,
        541.8435668945312,
        719.8994750976562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "rate linear layer, namely embeds and embeda respectively.",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        721.8919067382812,
        336.6380615234375,
        733.3485107421875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This results in the following tokens: T =",
      "bbox": [
        345.7227478027344,
        721.8919067382812,
        540.001953125,
        731.8544921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
